{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witchwood is a PSX Style First-Person horror game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before his death, your grandpa mentioned about a ritual hunt your family has been part of for generations, however, your grandpa never finished what he started and he always regretted it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left with his journal and a map, you go to finish what he started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the hunt however, you soon find out that nothing is what it seems and you are soon enough caught up in something more dark and sinister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hunter becomes the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PSX Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-Person Horror Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt stags and complete the ritual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide and run from the cultist chasing you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A horror game based on the Scottish myth of the White Stag</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453240?t=1744102965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453240?t=1744102965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453240/9c1ab6d6b3a8c49c0392a1a7ac79c2acb55fb6a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744102965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453240/9c1ab6d6b3a8c49c0392a1a7ac79c2acb55fb6a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744102965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":"Hunting, Cultist symbols, cultist stabbing the player. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witchwood is a PSX Style First-Person horror game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before his death, your g